        "value": "Warm Up"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "json": [
          {
            "text": "With my arcane prowess growing each day I am becoming more and more annoyed by the minor nuisances of life, thus I have devised an incantation capable of spending my body warmth even in the deepest of winters and iciest of deserts, I have achieved this by modifying an existing fire affinity spell, which means there is to be had a bit of caution when using this new device, it will also not enhance my capabilities of keeping that warmth, if I don't take the right precautions it will disperse just as fast as everything else"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
